<title>UK: LME - WAREHOUSE STOCK MOVEMENTS.</title>
<headline>LME - WAREHOUSE STOCK MOVEMENTS.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Aug 12 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are: copper up 3900, tin down 100, lead down 100, zinc up 1400, aluminium up 725, nickel up 336, aluminium alloy down 100</p>
</text>
